# Magus Tirth's Ancona Chicken at the Mirage Raceway.
# Sources: items.json / npcs.json (vendor; Magus Tirth is friendly to both
# sides); Forever's client data 1.60.1.70532 (ItemSparse price: 1g; every pet
# item teaches its companion when used).

step Magus Tirth
  tip Magus Tirth at the Mirage Raceway, the goblin and gnome racetrack in the Shimmering Flats of south-eastern Thousand Needles, sells the Ancona Chicken (1g) to both sides. The nearest flight paths are Freewind Post (Horde) and Gadgetzan in Tanaris (both sides); from Gadgetzan, ride north into the Shimmering Flats. Each pet item teaches its companion when you use it; the goal stays ticked afterwards.
  vendor 6548                         -- Magus Tirth
  buy 11023 npc 6548 optional         -- Ancona Chicken, 1g
